# ort-server curated operator set (the default for the musl releases): the union of
#   - every model of the six use cases of the prplOS engine study (text classification, sentence
#     embeddings, image classification, object detection, audio, time series; 17 models), converted
#     together with convert_onnx_models_to_ort --optimization_style Runtime, and
#   - bertfamily.required_operators.config (the v0.1.x set: BERT, DistilBERT, RoBERTa, DeBERTa v1/v2,
#     ELECTRA, ALBERT, ModernBERT; sequence and token classification).
# 60 operator entries. Build: tools/ort-musl-build.sh <arch> ops/curated.required_operators.config <dir>
ai.onnx;1;GlobalAveragePool,Not
ai.onnx;6;HardSigmoid
ai.onnx;7;Cos,Sin
ai.onnx;11;AveragePool,Conv,ConvTranspose,NonMaxSuppression,Range,TopK
ai.onnx;12;MaxPool
ai.onnx;13;Abs,Cast,Clip,Concat,DequantizeLinear,Equal,Erf,Exp,Expand,Flatten,Gather,GatherND,Gemm,Log,MatMul,Min,Neg,Pad,QuantizeLinear,ReduceL2,ReduceMean,ReduceSum,Resize,Sigmoid,Slice,Softmax,Sqrt,Squeeze,Tanh,Transpose,Unsqueeze
ai.onnx;14;Add,CumSum,Div,LSTM,Mul,Relu,Reshape,Sub
ai.onnx;15;Pow,Shape
ai.onnx;16;LessOrEqual,Where
ai.onnx;17;LayerNormalization
ai.onnx;18;Split
com.microsoft;1;FusedConv,QLinearConv,QLinearSigmoid
